{"unit_id":"abbaababa__dsh-mobile-access#card-zh","repo":"abbaababa/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"de3c245e5971c340e795c172d8e1663f040376ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 是面向 DSH Web 的手机访问插件，可让 iPhone 或 iPad 使用 Safari 连接电脑上的 DSH。它在 DSH 侧栏提供手机访问面板，显示配对网址、短时配对码和连接状态；手机提交配对码后获得 DSH 登录会话。若 DSH 只监听本机地址，插件可启动局域网网关转发到原有服务；同时针对 iOS 调整回车换行、剪贴板、输入缩放、侧栏会话切换和触控操作。适合希望在同一局域网内用手机继续使用电脑 DSH 会话的人，无需额外 API 密钥或第三方账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:16-40","src/routes.ts:342-576","src/client.ts:192-278","src/gateway.ts:129-203"]}
{"unit_id":"abbaababa__dsh-mobile-access#card-en","repo":"abbaababa/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"de3c245e5971c340e795c172d8e1663f040376ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mobile-access lets iPhone and iPad users open desktop DSH Web in Safari. A sidebar panel gives a pairing address and temporary code. For loopback-only HTTP setups, it can start a LAN gateway. It also adapts iOS keyboard, clipboard, zoom, and sidebar behavior for phone use.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:16-40","src/routes.ts:342-576","src/client.ts:192-278","src/gateway.ts:129-203"]}
