{"unit_id":"abbaababa__dsh-mobile-access#feature-1","repo":"abbaababa/dsh-mobile-access","commit":"de3c245e5971c340e795c172d8e1663f040376ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-access 的功能「配对手机访问」：在 DSH Web 侧栏打开手机访问面板，查看地址与 8 位配对码；手机用 Safari 访问 /m 并提交配对码，成功后进入 DSH 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:218-229","src/service.ts:7-12","src/routes.ts:392-478"]}
